    {
      "kind": "synopsis",
      "source_text": "最近、玄武から甘い匂いがすることが\n気になる朱雀。ところが彼は心当たりが\nないと言う。\nしかし、実は玄武は、朱雀の誕生日に向けて\nある準備を進めていたのだった。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 1
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-1:text",
        "step_id": 1,
        "step_index": 0,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "さて……。\n朱雀の祝いの準備も\nこれで一通りは整ったか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 4
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "英雄アニさんのおかげで、\n満足のいくパンケーキも\n作れるようになった。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "画竜点睛。\nあとは朱雀が来たら\n出来立てを振舞うだけだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "番長さんに呼び出しも頼んだ\nことだし、そろそろ朱雀が\n事務所に到着する頃合いか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……朱雀のヤツ、\nどんな顔をして、\n喜んでくれるんだろうな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日のために、パンケーキを作る\n練習をずっとしてたなんてよぉ。\n大変だったんじゃねぇか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "理想のパンケーキを作るまでに、\nいろんなレシピを試したぜ。\n例えば豆腐を入れたり……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "豆腐！？　パンケーキにか？\nぜんぜん想像がつかねぇぜ、\nどんな味になるんだ……！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "味が変わるっていうより、\n生地がふかふかになるんだ。\nあれもなかなかよかったぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "026gen",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へぇ、そいつは激アツだなぁ！\nもちもちもしっとりも好きだが、\nふかふかも食ってみてぇ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なら、今度それも焼いてやるよ。\nうまそうに食うお前のあの顔、\n俺もまた見てぇしな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
